OL,3,GNEWSAOmagh bomb inquiry hears from
OL,4,Aexpert on dissident republicanism
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inquiry into the Omagh bombing has
OL,7,Fheard from an academic expert on
OL,8,Fdissident republicanism.
OL,10,FTwenty-nine people, including a woman
OL,11,Fpregnant with twins, died in the Real
OL,12,FIRA bombing in the County Tyrone town
OL,13,Fon 15 August 1998 - the biggest single
OL,14,Fatrocity in the Troubles.
OL,16,FIt came less than three months after
OL,17,Fthe people of Northern Ireland had
OL,18,Fvoted yes to the Good Friday Agreement.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
